<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the</p>
<p>following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek</p>
<p>mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices,</p>
<p>as well as total net asset sizes as of July 23.</p>
<p>				  July 23/July 22  July 23/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.06		 8.22</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.03		 6.58</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.55		13.76</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			    0.32		52.69</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.99		38.39</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  1.04		39.01</p>
<p>  International funds		  -0.04		17.39</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.22		33.64</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			    1.04		48.01</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  1.08		46.65</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.59		31.73</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.52		98.21</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual</p>
<p>funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31,</p>
<p>1991.</p>
<p>NET ASSET SIZES (in drachmas)</p>
<p>  Total market				  5,628,726,661,988</p>
<p>  Fixed income funds			  2,000,873,389,508</p>
<p>  Money market funds			  3,281,132,635,670</p>
<p>  International funds			   103,552,360,270</p>
<p>  Growth funds				    243,168,276,541</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
